plist.dict:
CFBundlePackageType
APPL
CFBundleName
{{.Info.ProductName}}
CFBundleDisplayName
{{.Info.ProductName}}
CFBundleExecutable
{{.OutputFilename}}
CFBundleIdentifier
com.liuhang.quillite-markdown
CFBundleVersion
{{.Info.ProductVersion}}
CFBundleGetInfoString
{{.Info.Comments}}
CFBundleShortVersionString
{{.Info.ProductVersion}}
CFBundleIconFile
iconfile
LSMinimumSystemVersion
10.13.0
NSHighResolutionCapable
true
NSHumanReadableCopyright
{{.Info.Copyright}}
LSSupportsOpeningDocumentsInPlace

NSDocumentsFolderUsageDescription
轻阅 Markdown 需要访问您选择的文档，以便在重启后继续阅读和编辑。Quillite Markdown needs access to documents you choose so it can reopen them after restarting.
NSDesktopFolderUsageDescription
轻阅 Markdown 需要访问您在桌面上选择的文档。Quillite Markdown needs access to documents you choose on the Desktop.
NSDownloadsFolderUsageDescription
轻阅 Markdown 需要访问您在下载目录中选择的文档。Quillite Markdown needs access to documents you choose in Downloads.
NSNetworkVolumesUsageDescription
轻阅 Markdown 需要访问您在网络磁盘中选择的文档。Quillite Markdown needs access to documents you choose on network volumes.
NSRemovableVolumesUsageDescription
轻阅 Markdown 需要访问您在移动磁盘中选择的文档。Quillite Markdown needs access to documents you choose on removable volumes.
{{if .Info.FileAssociations}}
CFBundleDocumentTypes

  {{range .Info.FileAssociations}}

    CFBundleTypeExtensions

      {{.Ext}}

    CFBundleTypeName
    {{.Name}}
    CFBundleTypeRole
    {{.Role}}
    CFBundleTypeIconFile
    {{.IconName}}

  {{end}}

{{end}}
{{if .Info.Protocols}}
CFBundleURLTypes

  {{range .Info.Protocols}}

        CFBundleURLName
        com.wails.{{.Scheme}}
        CFBundleURLSchemes

            {{.Scheme}}

        CFBundleTypeRole
        {{.Role}}

  {{end}}

{{end}}
NSAppTransportSecurity

    NSAllowsLocalNetworking
